---

<Layout
  title="DOT 3 vs DOT 4 vs DOT 5 Brake Fluid: Chemistry & Manufacturing | Global Formulation"
  description="Technical guide on DOT 3, DOT 4, and DOT 5 brake fluids. Explaining glycol ether chemistry, borate ester cross-linking, silicone PDMS, and ABS viscosity limits."
  canonical="https://www.globalaerosols.com/brake-fluids-explained"
  ogImage="https://assets.zyrosite.com/AGBzPMBJDQiwDGny/dot-3-dot-4-dot-5-brake-fluid-hydraulic-system-q783XszLxYwYBHab.png"
